414888528444", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831382_1787414891861777_4927424954062211272_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3xQFXFQmOv4Q7kNvwGeKPRe&_nc_oc=AdrmsJehb21eo5-UBk-VbEAchR5U4eL-Z6t89h0oOF3vIHPHjU6PRaVoELEONiha-fc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9Ls8gBITb4z9xSz9Lp8a3vikPnEXIHENKrs7U_-z54CA&oe=6A3EAC3B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Steal a Sigmon", "keywords": ["Steal", "Sigmon", "Monkey", "Pet"], "long_description": "## Features:\n- **Beyond *Steal a Brainrot*** \u2013 Faster pace, deeper mechanics, and smarter AI.\n- **Dynamic Sigmon Behaviors** \u2013 No two matches feel the same.\n- **Full VR Interaction** \u2013 Leap, dodge, and grab with natural motion.\n- **Multiplayer Madness** \u2013 Compete, cooperate, or sabotage your way to victory.\n\n## Roadmap\n- **Post-EA** \u2013 Maintain a biweekly update schedule.\n- Arena layouts better optimized for VR.\n- Base personalization.\n- Private rooms.\n- Pet battles (PvP/PvE).\n- Events, including invasions, battles, and exploration.\n", "short_description": "The Best steal game in Quest! \nIt's far more funny than steal a brainrot!"}]}, "developer_name": "Sigmon VR", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.stealasigmon.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Sigmon VR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.stealasigmon.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_